{"id": "69032", "title": "临时同居", "author": "卓韵芝", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 6, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/69/69032.htm", "intro": "勤奋努力的地产经纪项少龙，求婚却因婚房太小而被拒。女友提出要在一年的时间里住上豪宅，对少龙来说简直就是个不可能的任务。每日都苦思赚钱大计的少龙突然遇到一个难得的好机会……", "base": "files/article/html/69/69032", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "10555261.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "10555262.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "10555263.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "10555264.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "10555265.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "10558376.html", "available": false}]}